        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw96khaf-1a0l7x",
        "model": "gpt-6"
      },
      "text": "The tour starts at 06:15.\n\nSpend the early morning watching Tortuguero's wildlife as it begins to stir.\n\nReturn for breakfast after the tour. Breakfast is served from 07:00 to 09:00.\n\nYou then have free time to relax by the pool or at the bar.\n\nDinner is served from 19:30 to 21:00. The rest of the evening is free.\n\n**Meals:** breakfast, lunch and dinner."
